{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into a vibrant pixel-art world where strategy and creativity collide! In this city-building deck-building game, every card is a piece of your puzzle. Place buildings on a dynamic hexagonal grid, optimize your resource generation, and manage prices to maximize your profits.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hexagonal City-Building:</strong> Place cards strategically to create a thriving city, balancing resources like Wheat, Meat, Metal, and Products. <strong>And u</strong>pgrade your city with houses, shops, and factories to boost resource production and create powerful combos.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3424190/extras/0258bc6160d37949c12e379c5620bfae.poster.avif?t=1761912792\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3424190/extras/0258bc6160d37949c12e379c5620bfae.webm?t=1761912792\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3424190/extras/0258bc6160d37949c12e379c5620bfae.mp4?t=1761912792\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Deck-Building Progression:</strong> Buy cards from a shop or select random rewards after each level to customize your deck and refine your strategy.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3424190/extras/06b35f19d3f6070f8be775448f2b29fc.poster.avif?t=1761912792\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3424190/extras/06b35f19d3f6070f8be775448f2b29fc.webm?t=1761912792\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/st